1
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,500
Just give the order. We'll charge up
north and catch them unawares

2
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:37,100
Then you can ascend the throne

3
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:41,100
Princess Ruining is the woman
I love most

4
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:45,100
Unless it can't be helped, I won't
clash with the Emperor head-on

5
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:51,100
Once I'm the Princess' husband, the
throne will be mine sooner or later

6
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,100
Why should I be impatient?

7
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:57,100
Marquis, you are wise!
You are wise!

8
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:01,100
Come and drink
the Number One Scholar Tea,

9
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:05,100
all of you who are going
to sit the imperial exams

10
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:08,100
It'll improve your memory and
give you a facile imagination

11
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:12,100
This tea is concocted by my brother,
the divine physician

12
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:16,100
I'm going to join the queue

13
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:21,100
You're putting all your money there.
I'm a physician too

14
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:24,100
How I spend my money
doesn't concern you

15
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,100
She's sick!

16
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,100
Remember to take your medicine

17
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,100
Physician Mei, it's my turn

18
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:39,100
-I need your help
-What is it regarding?

19
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:44,100
You're turning to me
because your husband can't do it?

20
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:48,100
I don't mean that.
Come in

21
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:54,100
Ma Ruyi!

22
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:59,100
Aren't you stupid!

23
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:01,100
Put it down

24
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:04,100
Chop that stuff

25
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,100
Just take a few pieces at a time

26
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:15,100
Coming!

27
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:19,100
Carry a stool here for me

28
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:27,100
Pound my legs for me

29
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,100
Ma Ruyi

30
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:32,100
Get me a cup of tea

31
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:36,100
-Ma Ruyi, pound my legs for me!
-Ma Ruyi, get me a cup of tea!

32
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:40,100
That's enough! Ma Ruyi, sit down
over there and take a rest

33
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:47,100
Keep quiet, the two of you.
Ma Ruyi, take a rest over there!

34
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:50,100
I can take a break

35
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:54,100
Ma Ruyi, my child moved his bowels.
Come and clean up after him

36
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:10,100
Everybody, this is our secret weapon.
Her gongfu is peerless!

37
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:16,100
The moment robbers hear her name,
they'll pee in their pants

38
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:20,100
She's none other than the first
woman constable, Golden Swallow!

39
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:27,100
Ma Ruyi, stop pulling a long face.
Cheer up!

40
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:38,100
Golden Swallow is going to perform
an item called Invincible Thunderbolt

41
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:49,100
You can be assured your valuables
will reach their destination safely

42
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:53,100
Fu Qi Armed Escort Agency
has a guaranteed reputation

43
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:59,100
Next, Golden Swallow will show us
no weapon can touch her

44
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:09,100
Breaking a boulder with her chest

45
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:19,100
Give her a big hand!

46
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:31,100
-Which of you is Wu Fuqi?
-That's me

47
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:35,100
Impressive! I want you to
escort something for me

48
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:42,100
My name is Jiang Dahua.
I run a bank

49
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:49,100
Boss Jiang, be assured all your goods
will be delivered safely

50
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:55,100
-Where do you want the goods delivered?
-Panlong Hill

51
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:04,100
Old Geezer!
Old Geezer!

52
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:06,500
Old Geezer!
Come out!

53
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:12,100
Your Obedience Spell
has got me in big trouble

54
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:17,100
The problem doesn't lie
with the spell

55
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:23,100
You are in this state
because of your personality

56
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:26,100
Some people are by nature obedient

57
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:31,100
So they don't find the
Obedience Spell a problem

58
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:36,100
You, on the other hand,
have to temper yourself...

59
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:40,100
be it as a human
or an immortal

60
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:44,100
The leopard never changes
its spots

61
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:48,100
No matter how hard I try, I can never
become an obedient person

62
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:53,100
I know I offended you in the past
but I've suffered enough

63
00:06:55,500 --> 00:07:00,100
Do you really think
I'm that petty?

64
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:06,100
Please lift the spell for me then.
I'll be so grateful to you

65
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:09,100
I have to consider

66
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:13,100
Haven't you tortured me enough?

67
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:18,100
If you don't lift the spell,
I'm staying put

68
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:25,100
How could you be so perverse!

69
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:29,100
You don't want me to pester you?
Lift the spell!

70
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:31,100
Fine.
I'm scared of you

71
00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:35,100
Really!

72
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,100
Read this carefully

73
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:45,500
This is the prescription
which will lift the spell

74
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,100
Prescription?

75
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:53,100
"A stalk of red plum blossom
stands proudly in the snow

76
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:56,100
A goodbye kiss is given
amidst flowers in clusters

77
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:59,100
The chirping of birds
is heard

78
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:03,100
At the end of the cave
stands a maple"

79
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:06,100
The poem is not bad, eh?

80
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:10,100
This is no prescription
but a poem

81
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:13,100
If you don't understand the poem,

82
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:17,100
you have to keep on
being obedient

83
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:21,100
You know I know nothing about poems
yet you deliberately test me with one

84
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:25,100
I have no patience to make guesses.
Just tell me what it's all about

85
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:32,100
That won't do. You agreed to let me
cast the Obedience Spell on you...

86
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:35,100
in exchange for Mei Shouquan's life

87
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:42,100
Now you want me to lift the spell
just like that. Isn't that unfair?

88
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:45,100
You'll be the death of me!

89
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:50,100
I'll be shaken to death
before you die

90
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:56,100
Why don't you look at this
from a different angle?

91
00:08:56,500 --> 00:09:02,100
You can consider it a joy of life!

92
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:08,100
You're teasing me and enjoying
yourself at my expense!

93
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:11,100
You have no intention
of helping me!

94
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:14,100
If you choose to think that way,
there's nothing I can do

95
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:19,100
If you want the spell to be lifted,
you have to follow certain rules

96
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:22,100
If you don't want to rack
your brains, give it back to me!

97
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:24,100
Wishful thinking!

98
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:27,100
You think too lowly of me!
I won't be daunted

99
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:32,100
You have no respect
for the old!

100
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:36,100
Chief, we looked everywhere
but she's nowhere to be found

101
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:39,100
This is so worrisome!
Where has Ma Ruyi gone?

102
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:44,100
Just where has Ma Ruyi gone?

103
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:49,100
Since she can't be found,
we'll set off ourselves!

104
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:54,100
Without Miss Ma's protection, we won't
be able to make it up to Panlong Hill

105
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:59,100
Given our skills, there's no way
we can escort the goods up the hill

106
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:03,100
Many highly skilled exponents
are found in the hill...

107
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:07,100
including one who feeds on
human flesh!

108
00:10:09,100 --> 00:10:12,100
I heard there's a scorpion there
whose poison is so potent...

109
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:15,100
that it can make you suffer
a fate worse than death

110
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:23,100
I heard they have a torture instrument
which tears off your flesh

111
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:27,100
I heard they like to hang you upside
down and drain you of your blood

112
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:29,100
That's enough

113
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:35,100
This deal is worth 50 taels of silver.
If we give it up, what will we live on?

114
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:40,100
50 taels isn't enough to pay for
the funeral expenses of the six of us

115
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:45,100
That's enough! Stop boosting the morale
of others and putting ourselves down

116
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:52,100
There's no way you can skip this trip
unless the sky falls on you

117
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:54,500
Don't even think of sneaking off

118
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:59,500
Go and get ready!
Hurry!

119
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:03,100
You guys are really...

120
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,500
You still can't find Sister Ma?

121
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:08,100
I think she's avoiding us

122
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:12,100
Serves you right for making her
perform this and that

123
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:15,100
Can't you stop doing things
like that?

124
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:18,100
Nothing you say now helps!

125
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:22,100
Why don't you come with us?

126
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:26,100
But I don't know gongfu
and won't be of any help

127
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:31,100
I know you don't know gongfu.
But you can act as if you do

128
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:33,100
Me?

129
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:36,100
You want me to pass myself off
as Sister Ma again?

130
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:39,100
-No deal!
-You can do it

131
00:11:39,500 --> 00:11:43,100
You're experienced
and very good at it

132
00:11:43,500 --> 00:11:47,100
Have you forgotten?
You even had me fooled the other time

133
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:54,100
Very well, I'll help you.
I'll disguise myself one more time

134
00:11:57,500 --> 00:12:01,100
With Ma Ruyi here,
who'd dare have designs on me?

135
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:20,100
Long time no see.
Are you doing fine?

136
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:24,100
Far from it.
I'm about to be tortured to death

137
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:27,100
What's going on?

138
00:12:27,500 --> 00:12:31,100
I've been a security guard, nanny,
bodyguard and what-have-you

139
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:34,100
But I don't get paid at all

140
00:12:34,500 --> 00:12:36,100
You did all that
of your own volition?

141
00:12:38,500 --> 00:12:41,100
I'm actually suffering
from an affliction

142
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:43,100
Affliction?

143
00:12:44,500 --> 00:12:47,100
Someone cast an obedience spell
on me

144
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:51,100
Obedience spell?
Never heard of that

145
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:56,100
A person under this spell
will do everything she's told to do

146
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:58,100
But that's terrible

147
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:02,100
If I say: Ma Ruyi, slap your right
cheek with your right hand...

148
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:08,100
Ma Ruyi, stop it!

149
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:13,100
Now you know how pitiful I am

150
00:13:13,500 --> 00:13:15,100
You poor thing

151
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:18,100
What can I do to help you?

152
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:20,100
I've got a prescription

153
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:24,100
I'll get it filled for you

154
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:28,100
This isn't an ordinary prescription
but a poem

155
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:30,100
The spell lies within it

156
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:36,100
Given Wei Delu's literary talent,
why don't you go to him?

157
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:41,100
Wei Delu has always been arrogant.
He only acts upon what you say

158
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:44,100
If you approach him,
he will say yes

159
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:46,100
Very well

160
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:48,100
Thank you, Princess

161
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:51,100
But I've got to go into hiding

162
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:54,100
I'm beat carrying out
their commands

163
00:13:55,500 --> 00:14:01,100
Just leave the matter to me. Ma Ruyi,
you must be tired. Go and rest

164
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:09,100
Ma Ruyi!

165
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:15,100
Ma Ruyi

166
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:17,700
Princess, what brings you here?

167
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:23,600
As the new top scholar, you should act
prudently. Gossip is a fearful thing

168
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:28,000
-I know
-Then you should restrain yourself

169
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:37,900
I have a clear conscience.
I don't care what other people say

170
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:45,800
There's one exception. She only has
to say the word and I'll do it

171
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:48,900
-Who's that?
-You

172
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:50,900
I haven't finished

173
00:14:52,300 --> 00:14:56,900
This is both your strength
and your fatal weakness

174
00:14:57,300 --> 00:14:59,900
Princess, I've always been like that

175
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:03,500
I won't become over-cautious
just because I'm an official now

176
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:05,500
That's being hopelessly stupid

177
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:10,700
I know it's not easy to make you
change your personality

178
00:15:12,100 --> 00:15:13,700
Be careful in future

179
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:17,700
I have a favour to ask of you

180
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,700
Please speak

181
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:25,000
I've got a poem here
which I don't understand

182
00:15:25,100 --> 00:15:27,700
You're more talented than me.
Could you take a look?

183
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:38,700
"A stalk of red plum blossom
stands proudly in the snow

184
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:43,700
A goodbye kiss is given
amidst flowers in clusters

185
00:15:45,100 --> 00:15:48,700
The chirping of birds is heard

186
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:54,700
At the end of the cave
stands a maple"

187
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:02,700
Official Wei,
why are you so quiet?

188
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:18,700
Do you really want me to do it?

189
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:22,700
You've unravelled
the secret of the poem?

190
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:46,700
I'm unable to reciprocate
your deep feelings for me

191
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:08,700
I'm ready to fulfill your wish

192
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:13,700
What are you trying to do?

193
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:22,700
Close your eyes and I'll do it

194
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:29,700
What are you doing?

195
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:34,700
This is outrageous!
How dare you be rude to me!

196
00:17:35,100 --> 00:17:39,700
Why did you slap me?
The poem says a passionate kiss

197
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:45,700
I asked you about the poem on someone's
behalf. It has nothing to do with me

198
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:59,700
Princess, since you've expressed
your feelings through the poem,

199
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:01,700
why purposely make
a mystery of things?

200
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:07,700
She's had me baffled

201
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:13,700
It's as if my heart is floating
in the sea

202
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:18,700
I've lost my way
and I am totally helpless

203
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:23,700
Could you tell me
if the Princess loves me?

204
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:26,700
Do I have a place in her heart?

205
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:33,700
If I have a place in her heart,
pop your head out and give a nod

206
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:49,700
It's too tiring for you
to pop your head out?

207
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:55,700
Tell you what.
If the Princess loves me,

208
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:58,700
keep still

209
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:09,700
I knew it. I'm a fine-looking guy
and a Number One Scholar

210
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:13,700
The princess has no reason
not to like me

211
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:25,700
Did the Princess show me that poem
because she loves me?

212
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:31,700
If she wrote that poem...
keep still as before

213
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:37,700
I knew it

214
00:19:38,100 --> 00:19:42,700
Out of shyness, she claimed she asked
me about the poem on another's behalf

215
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:48,700
Am I right? I should have held her
tight and kissed her passionately

216
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:54,700
To think that I rinsed my mouth
and acted so bashfully

217
00:19:55,100 --> 00:20:00,700
I was such a failure,
such a failure!

218
00:20:01,100 --> 00:20:02,700
A passionate kiss

219
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:09,700
A kiss full of passion

220
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:13,700
Thanks for pointing the way
out to me

221
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:17,700
I won't forget your kindness.
Cheers!

222
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:22,700
You drink some too.
That's it

223
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:30,700
Wait! I couldn't move my head
in time. Don't get the wrong idea

224
00:20:31,100 --> 00:20:33,700
You're simply too impatient

225
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:39,700
-Brother Fuqi, I'm very tired
-Hang on! Hang on!

226
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:43,700
Once we pass through here,
we'll be safe

227
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:49,700
Halt!

228
00:21:01,100 --> 00:21:02,700
What's this for?

229
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:06,700
What a silly question!
This is a robbery

230
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:10,700
Do you think
we came here to take a leak?

231
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:15,700
Leave your valuables behind
or your head will roll!

232
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:17,700
Robbery?

233
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:22,700
Take a good look before
you even think of robbing us!

234
00:21:23,100 --> 00:21:25,700
Look who's behind

235
00:21:26,100 --> 00:21:28,700
-I'm Golden Swallow
-Golden Swallow?

236
00:21:29,100 --> 00:21:30,700
That's her

237
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:35,700
Tell me your names.
If you let me pass,

238
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:39,700
I will repay your kindness

239
00:21:40,100 --> 00:21:44,700
Since Golden Swallow asked,
we should show her some respect

240
00:21:45,100 --> 00:21:47,700
In that case, move aside

241
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:51,700
Let us pass.
Hurry

242
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:55,700
Thank you.
Let's go!

243
00:21:56,100 --> 00:21:57,700
Set off!

244
00:21:58,100 --> 00:22:01,700
Stop there!
She isn't the real Golden Swallow

245
00:22:03,100 --> 00:22:07,700
Who said that? Step out!
I'll show you what I'm capable of

246
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:09,700
I said that

247
00:22:11,100 --> 00:22:15,700
-Teacher?! Long time no see
-You're no disciple of mine!

248
00:22:16,100 --> 00:22:19,700
-This Golden Swallow is an imposter?
-Surround them

249
00:22:22,100 --> 00:22:23,700
Freeze!

250
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:28,700
Teacher, weren't you doing time?

251
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:33,700
Money makes the mare go

252
00:22:35,100 --> 00:22:40,700
I had someone grease Shi Yaoqian's
palm. Thinking I was mad, he freed me

253
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:44,700
He freed you? That's great!
Congratulations!

254
00:22:45,100 --> 00:22:47,700
I wish you good health.
May all go well for you

255
00:22:48,100 --> 00:22:49,700
I'll buy you tea
one of these days

256
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:53,100
I'm off!
Come on, let's go

257
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:56,700
Stop there! I vowed to kill you
and Golden Swallow in revenge!

258
00:23:13,100 --> 00:23:15,700
I vowed to kill you
and Golden Swallow in revenge

259
00:23:17,100 --> 00:23:18,700
Meet your doom!

260
00:23:21,100 --> 00:23:25,700
I've recently mastered a skill which
makes my fist an invincible force

261
00:23:26,100 --> 00:23:30,700
My fist is now so strong that
it can make a hole in the ground

262
00:23:31,100 --> 00:23:33,700
You'd better not come over

263
00:23:34,100 --> 00:23:37,700
Don't I know your capability? I can
twist your hand off with one finger

264
00:23:38,100 --> 00:23:41,700
Grab the things
and take the woman too

265
00:23:42,100 --> 00:23:43,700
Just a minute

266
00:23:45,100 --> 00:23:48,700
Since you won't believe me,
I'll show you what I'm capable of

267
00:23:49,100 --> 00:23:53,700
-I'm sorry, Teacher
-Come on! Come on!

268
00:24:08,100 --> 00:24:10,700
Why did it lose power
at the last minute?

269
00:24:20,100 --> 00:24:21,700
Brother Fuqi,
are you all right?

270
00:25:04,100 --> 00:25:07,700
Attack me!
Come on!

271
00:25:17,100 --> 00:25:19,700
This is what you get for
not believing me

272
00:25:22,100 --> 00:25:24,700
Mei Shouquan, step out here!

273
00:25:27,100 --> 00:25:29,700
If you are a man, step out!

274
00:25:30,100 --> 00:25:32,700
I'll show you what I'm capable of

275
00:25:33,100 --> 00:25:35,700
He doesn't dare step out.
This shows he's guilty!

276
00:25:38,100 --> 00:25:41,700
Why are you training your voice
here so early in the morning?

277
00:25:42,100 --> 00:25:44,700
Train my voice?
Who's so free to do that?

278
00:25:45,100 --> 00:25:49,700
That brother of yours
has got my wife pregnant

279
00:25:51,100 --> 00:25:54,700
Your wife is expecting?
That's great

280
00:25:57,100 --> 00:25:58,700
Listen!

281
00:25:59,100 --> 00:26:06,700
Gold Tooth, what makes you say that
my brother got your wife pregnant?

282
00:26:08,100 --> 00:26:11,700
My wife has admitted to it.
So how can it not be true?

283
00:26:13,100 --> 00:26:15,700
Brother, let me ask you

284
00:26:16,100 --> 00:26:20,700
You didn't get his wife
pregnant, did you?

285
00:26:21,100 --> 00:26:24,700
Yes, I admit to it

286
00:26:25,100 --> 00:26:27,700
If not for me, how would
his wife have got pregnant?

287
00:26:28,100 --> 00:26:30,700
He admitted to it himself

288
00:26:31,100 --> 00:26:35,700
Why are you shouting? Haven't you and
your wife always longed for a child?

289
00:26:36,100 --> 00:26:37,700
Your wish is granted

290
00:26:40,100 --> 00:26:45,700
Whether we have a child or not
is none of your business

291
00:26:47,100 --> 00:26:48,700
Stop it!

292
00:26:49,100 --> 00:26:52,700
Why are you assaulting
our benefactor?

293
00:26:53,100 --> 00:26:54,700
I haven't settled my score
with you

294
00:26:55,100 --> 00:26:57,700
Don't get upset
or it'll affect the baby

295
00:26:59,100 --> 00:27:02,700
The child isn't the flesh
and blood of the Meis, is it?

296
00:27:03,100 --> 00:27:07,700
Don't talk rot! Physician Mei
treated me for infertility

297
00:27:08,100 --> 00:27:12,700
Then I got pregnant.
I'm carrying Gold Tooth's child

298
00:27:14,100 --> 00:27:16,700
The truth is finally out!

299
00:27:18,100 --> 00:27:21,700
I know the child is mine.
I'm mad because...

300
00:27:22,100 --> 00:27:25,700
you approached him instead of me
for help - I'm a physician too

301
00:27:27,100 --> 00:27:31,700
So what if you're a physician? How
can your skills be compared to his?

302
00:27:32,100 --> 00:27:33,700
In what way am I inferior to him?

303
00:27:34,100 --> 00:27:39,700
You treated our neighbour, Xu Buliang,
for years but to no effect

304
00:27:40,100 --> 00:27:45,700
All Physician Mei did was stick a needle
in him and the problem was solved

305
00:27:46,100 --> 00:27:48,700
He and his wife even had a child

306
00:27:49,100 --> 00:27:51,700
To think you'd side with an outsider
and not me

307
00:27:52,100 --> 00:27:55,700
Gold Tooth,
what are you screaming for?

308
00:27:56,100 --> 00:28:01,700
If you were highly skilled, your wife
wouldn't have approached me for help

309
00:28:03,100 --> 00:28:07,700
Who says I'm not highly skilled?
I'll be honest with you

310
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:10,700
I just didn't want my wife
to get pregnant

311
00:28:11,100 --> 00:28:12,700
Really?

312
00:28:13,100 --> 00:28:15,700
So it was premeditated

313
00:28:17,100 --> 00:28:19,700
Just what are you up to?

314
00:28:21,100 --> 00:28:23,700
-I'll talk! I'll talk!
-Out with it!

315
00:28:24,100 --> 00:28:29,700
If you're able to reproduce,
I won't get to take another wife

316
00:28:33,100 --> 00:28:34,700
I see

317
00:28:35,100 --> 00:28:36,700
Serves you right

318
00:28:43,100 --> 00:28:48,700
I'll be honest with you. As long as
I live, I won't let you take a concubine

319
00:28:49,100 --> 00:28:53,700
Don't even think of doing that.
Let's go home!

320
00:28:59,100 --> 00:29:02,700
Mrs Gold Tooth, remember to take
your medicine to keep the baby safe

321
00:29:03,100 --> 00:29:06,700
My brother can effect a miraculous cure
and bring the dying back to life

322
00:29:07,100 --> 00:29:11,700
If you're trying for triplets
or quads, go to him

323
00:29:15,100 --> 00:29:17,700
Boss, count your goods

324
00:29:24,100 --> 00:29:25,700
Thanks

325
00:29:26,100 --> 00:29:28,700
This is your payment

326
00:29:33,100 --> 00:29:37,700
This is the payment for our first deal.
I'll treat you to a feast tonight

327
00:29:40,100 --> 00:29:44,700
How did you manage to summon
the force in your right fist again?

328
00:29:45,100 --> 00:29:49,700
No idea. In my anxiety to protect you,
I unconsciously executed the skill

329
00:29:50,100 --> 00:29:54,700
-Can you do that again now?
-No idea. Let me try it out on you

330
00:29:56,100 --> 00:29:58,700
Don't worry, I won't use
a lot of force

331
00:30:06,100 --> 00:30:07,700
Official Wei!

332
00:30:09,100 --> 00:30:10,700
Official Wei!

333
00:30:19,100 --> 00:30:21,700
"Princess, I knew you'd be back

334
00:30:22,100 --> 00:30:25,700
Since our last parting,
I've had many sleepless nights

335
00:30:26,100 --> 00:30:28,700
Take five steps forward
and look right"

336
00:30:32,100 --> 00:30:36,700
1,2,3,4,5!

337
00:30:41,100 --> 00:30:44,700
"I don't know how to express
my regret to you

338
00:30:45,100 --> 00:30:48,700
Turn left, take five steps back
and turn around"

339
00:30:49,100 --> 00:30:50,700
Turn left

340
00:31:00,100 --> 00:31:02,700
"Latest invention.
Look up!"

341
00:31:11,100 --> 00:31:13,700
"I'm sorry, Princess"

342
00:31:19,100 --> 00:31:22,700
"I love you, Princess"

343
00:31:40,100 --> 00:31:42,700
That was a great feeling, eh?

344
00:31:43,100 --> 00:31:45,700
I spent a lot of money
to invent that

345
00:31:49,100 --> 00:31:52,700
I never had the chance
to express my love for you

346
00:31:53,100 --> 00:31:58,700
I also know your father, His Majesty,
is going to marry you to Ouyang Xiaotian

347
00:31:59,100 --> 00:32:01,700
I hope you'll understand
my feelings for you

348
00:32:03,100 --> 00:32:06,700
Official Wei, I'm very grateful
for the concern you show me

349
00:32:07,100 --> 00:32:09,700
-But...
-But what?

350
00:32:11,100 --> 00:32:14,700
Princess, would you like to come up
and sit here?

351
00:32:16,100 --> 00:32:22,700
I... and Ouyang Xiaotian were childhood
sweethearts. We love each other

352
00:32:23,100 --> 00:32:28,700
I regard you as a bosom friend.
I'm afraid you've got the wrong idea

353
00:32:29,100 --> 00:32:33,700
You only regard me as a friend
and confidant?

354
00:32:35,100 --> 00:32:37,700
I don't believe you.
I don't believe you

355
00:32:38,100 --> 00:32:41,700
Have you forgotten
what happened in the desert?

356
00:32:42,100 --> 00:32:44,700
I spoke from the bottom
of my heart

357
00:32:46,100 --> 00:32:49,700
I will marry Ouyang Xiaotian
and no other

358
00:32:50,100 --> 00:32:54,700
You're saying you only love Ouyang
Xiaotian and will marry no other?

359
00:32:56,100 --> 00:32:59,700
But before you go through
the wedding ceremony with him,

360
00:33:00,100 --> 00:33:02,700
I can still express my love
for you

361
00:33:04,100 --> 00:33:07,700
Princess,
you've got to give me a chance

362
00:33:10,100 --> 00:33:13,700
You said you'd marry Ouyang Xiaotian
and no other

363
00:33:15,100 --> 00:33:17,700
Before you go through
the wedding ceremony with him,

364
00:33:18,100 --> 00:33:21,700
I should be given the chance
to express my love for you

365
00:33:24,100 --> 00:33:27,700
Unless... unless you tell me
you dislike me

366
00:33:29,100 --> 00:33:32,700
Go on, say you dislike me now

367
00:33:33,100 --> 00:33:34,100
Say it

368
00:33:35,100 --> 00:33:40,700
With your talent, I'm sure
you'll be able to find a better girl

369
00:33:41,100 --> 00:33:42,700
I'm off

370
00:34:03,100 --> 00:34:07,700
Bad news! Physician Mei,
you're wanted by the authorities!

371
00:34:13,100 --> 00:34:14,700
That's him

372
00:34:15,100 --> 00:34:16,700
-What's up?
-Someone reported you

373
00:34:17,100 --> 00:34:18,700
-Who?
-It was me

374
00:34:19,100 --> 00:34:20,700
What did you report me for?

375
00:34:21,100 --> 00:34:23,700
My wife became dumb
after you treated her

376
00:34:24,100 --> 00:34:25,700
Your wife lost her voice?

377
00:34:26,100 --> 00:34:30,700
After taking the medicine
you prescribed her

378
00:34:31,100 --> 00:34:37,700
An expectant mother might lose her voice
during the ninth month of pregnancy

379
00:34:38,100 --> 00:34:41,700
Your wife might be weak
so this happened to her early

380
00:34:42,100 --> 00:34:44,700
I'm not to blame

381
00:34:45,100 --> 00:34:48,700
Whether you're responsible or not,
let the yamen decide that

382
00:34:50,100 --> 00:34:54,700
Just a minute.
I have two patients waiting for me

383
00:34:55,100 --> 00:34:57,700
Can I see them
before I leave with you?

384
00:34:58,100 --> 00:35:01,700
You still want to treat patients? You
aren't content till you kill somebody?

385
00:35:02,100 --> 00:35:04,700
You think you're that great?

386
00:35:05,100 --> 00:35:08,700
Do you think all patients will die
unless you treat them?

387
00:35:14,100 --> 00:35:16,700
He made you lose your voice.
What are you doing here?

388
00:35:17,100 --> 00:35:19,700
You've maligned Physician Mei

389
00:35:20,100 --> 00:35:23,700
-You can talk?
-Gold Tooth, you took us for a ride

390
00:35:24,100 --> 00:35:26,700
I thought you said
she couldn't talk

391
00:35:27,100 --> 00:35:29,700
She couldn't talk in the morning
but now...

392
00:35:30,100 --> 00:35:34,700
-Stick out your tongue!
-Mei Shouquan, why is she able to talk?

393
00:35:37,100 --> 00:35:38,700
The reason is very simple

394
00:35:39,100 --> 00:35:41,700
Why did your wife
suddenly lose her voice?

395
00:35:42,100 --> 00:35:46,700
Her passages have been blocked
due to a lack of exercise...

396
00:35:47,100 --> 00:35:49,700
and the foetus pressing on them

397
00:35:50,100 --> 00:35:52,700
How did she recover her voice?

398
00:35:53,100 --> 00:35:57,700
In her anxiety to get here,
she ran very fast,

399
00:35:58,100 --> 00:36:02,700
thus raising her body temperature
and clearing the passages

400
00:36:03,100 --> 00:36:06,700
You don't even know that?
Some physician you are!

401
00:36:07,100 --> 00:36:10,700
You took us for a ride!
Come with us to the yamen!

402
00:36:11,100 --> 00:36:15,700
Officer, we're sorry for
the trouble caused

403
00:36:16,100 --> 00:36:17,700
Please leave

404
00:36:20,100 --> 00:36:22,700
Apologize to Physician Mei

405
00:36:23,100 --> 00:36:24,700
He was just lucky

406
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:28,700
Lucky, my foot!
I'll kill you

407
00:36:29,100 --> 00:36:34,700
You should exercise more but not
too hard. Kicking his butt will do

408
00:36:35,100 --> 00:36:38,700
But don't kick too high
or it'll affect the baby

409
00:36:39,100 --> 00:36:41,700
It'll be a pity
if you lose the baby

410
00:36:42,100 --> 00:36:44,700
You truly are a divine physician

411
00:36:45,100 --> 00:36:47,700
Let's go!
Move it!

412
00:36:52,100 --> 00:36:55,700
-My respects to you, Princess
-Dispense with formalities

413
00:36:56,100 --> 00:36:58,700
Wei Delu explained the poem

414
00:36:59,100 --> 00:37:01,700
How can the Obedience Spell
be lifted?

415
00:37:03,100 --> 00:37:05,700
When you kiss passionately

416
00:37:07,100 --> 00:37:08,700
I beg your pardon?

417
00:37:09,100 --> 00:37:13,700
The spell will be lifted
when the man who loves you...

418
00:37:14,100 --> 00:37:17,700
and whom you are in love with
kiss passionately

419
00:37:19,100 --> 00:37:23,700
Where am I going to find a man
whom I love and who loves me?

420
00:37:24,100 --> 00:37:28,700
You've got to ask yourself
if there's someone you love

421
00:37:31,100 --> 00:37:32,700
I don't know

422
00:37:34,100 --> 00:37:38,700
You didn't say there wasn't anyone.
This means that person does exist

423
00:37:39,100 --> 00:37:42,700
How to tell
if I love a person?

424
00:37:43,100 --> 00:37:46,700
When someone you love falls ill,
you'll feel anxious

425
00:37:47,100 --> 00:37:49,700
When he's unhappy,
you'll feel sad for him

426
00:37:50,100 --> 00:37:51,700
When he's in danger,
you'll feel worried for him

427
00:37:52,100 --> 00:37:55,700
His emotions will affect
your moods

428
00:37:58,100 --> 00:38:01,700
-You have someone in mind?
-No

429
00:38:02,100 --> 00:38:04,700
-Ma Ruyi, who's your sweetheart?
-Mei Shouquan

430
00:38:06,100 --> 00:38:09,700
Physician Mei?
You have good judgment

431
00:38:10,100 --> 00:38:11,700
Don't tell anyone this

432
00:38:12,100 --> 00:38:16,700
I'm in no mood to gossip about others.
I feel vexed enough as it is

433
00:38:19,100 --> 00:38:21,700
Princess, you're troubled by
affairs of the heart too?

434
00:38:22,100 --> 00:38:26,700
When I approached Wei Delu
to explain the poem,

435
00:38:27,100 --> 00:38:29,700
he thought I was giving him a hint

436
00:38:31,100 --> 00:38:34,700
Wei Delu thought you wanted to share
a kiss with him? The cheek of him!

437
00:38:35,100 --> 00:38:39,700
But knowing how hurt he feels,
I don't hold it against him

438
00:38:40,100 --> 00:38:44,700
I regard him as a confidant. There
are no romantic feelings involved

439
00:38:45,100 --> 00:38:49,700
Besides, Father has betrothed me
to Ouyang Xiaotian

440
00:38:51,100 --> 00:38:55,700
Pardon me for asking you this. Do you
and Ouyang Xiaotian love each other?

441
00:38:57,700 --> 00:39:02,700
There's only Xiaotian in my heart and
I believe his feelings for me are true

442
00:39:03,100 --> 00:39:06,700
-But...
-But what?

443
00:39:07,100 --> 00:39:11,700
I find he's been hiding
many things from me

444
00:39:12,100 --> 00:39:14,700
I feel I understand him
less and less

445
00:39:16,100 --> 00:39:19,700
-What are you going to do?
-I don't know

446
00:39:20,100 --> 00:39:22,700
I'll take things as they come

447
00:39:25,700 --> 00:39:29,700
Affairs of the heart
can really drive one crazy

448
00:39:37,100 --> 00:39:40,700
Affairs of the heart...

449
00:39:41,100 --> 00:39:43,700
really drives one crazy

450
00:39:45,100 --> 00:39:46,700
Not necessarily so

451
00:39:47,100 --> 00:39:52,700
If you meet someone whom you love
and who loves you,

452
00:39:53,100 --> 00:39:56,700
the feeling of joy
is indescribable

453
00:39:57,100 --> 00:40:00,700
Shuangxi, have you ever kissed
passionately with Fu?

454
00:40:01,100 --> 00:40:07,700
Of course not! We behave
within the bounds of propriety

455
00:40:08,100 --> 00:40:11,700
I was just asking.
Don't get so worked up

456
00:40:12,100 --> 00:40:15,700
What about you and Master Mei?

457
00:40:16,100 --> 00:40:18,700
Do you behave within
the bounds of propriety too?

458
00:40:19,100 --> 00:40:21,700
Why do all of you keep thinking
Shou and I are an item?

459
00:40:22,100 --> 00:40:26,700
The onlooker sees the game best
while the gamester is muddle-headed

460
00:40:27,100 --> 00:40:29,700
I'm muddle-headed?
Surely not?

461
00:40:30,100 --> 00:40:34,700
I can't talk to you anymore. My sis
is waiting for me at home. I'm off

462
00:40:45,100 --> 00:40:47,700
A stalk of red plum blossom
stands quietly in the snow

463
00:40:48,100 --> 00:40:51,700
A goodbye kiss is given
amidst flowers in clusters

464
00:40:52,100 --> 00:40:55,700
The chirping of birds is heard

465
00:40:56,100 --> 00:40:58,700
At the end of the cave
stands a maple

466
00:41:01,100 --> 00:41:04,700
-Ruyi, this poem...
-You can tell its meaning?

467
00:41:05,100 --> 00:41:07,700
Yes but it's out of the question

468
00:41:08,100 --> 00:41:10,700
You can do it
unless you don't want to

469
00:41:11,100 --> 00:41:14,700
I'd like to but I'm afraid the spirit
is willing but the flesh is weak

470
00:41:15,100 --> 00:41:17,700
Are you a man?
Have you no guts at all?

471
00:41:18,100 --> 00:41:21,700
I have guts
but this poem is so well-written

472
00:41:22,100 --> 00:41:24,700
I don't know
how to continue it

473
00:41:25,100 --> 00:41:27,700
Fool! I'm not asking you
to continue the poem

474
00:41:28,100 --> 00:41:29,700
What do you want me to do?

475
00:41:30,100 --> 00:41:31,700
You'll be the death of me!

476
00:41:33,100 --> 00:41:35,700
Just what do you want me to do?
Say it

477
00:41:41,100 --> 00:41:43,700
Your neck is very long.
Are you all right?

478
00:41:51,100 --> 00:41:54,700
Look at your lips!
Do you need to see a physician?

479
00:42:02,100 --> 00:42:06,700
Shou, the meaning of the poem
is a passionate kiss

480
00:42:07,100 --> 00:42:09,700
I have to kiss passionately
to lift the spell

481
00:42:12,100 --> 00:42:13,700
I'll do it myself

482
00:42:27,100 --> 00:42:31,700
You're not allowed to kiss!
You're not allowed to kiss!

483
00:42:36,100 --> 00:42:38,700
You're not allowed to kiss!

484
00:42:50,100 --> 00:42:51,700
Here I go

485
00:43:09,100 --> 00:43:11,100
Pay up! Pay up!

486
00:43:12,100 --> 00:43:14,700
